### Get all cuisines

GET http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/cuisines

### Get cuisine by uuid (Polish)

GET http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/cuisines/d290f1ee-6c54-4b01-90e6-d701748f0001

### Create cuisine (Mexican)

POST http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/cuisines
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mexican",
  "continent": "NORTH_AMERICA",
  "spicy": true
}

### Get non-existing cuisine (404)

