### Get all recipes

GET http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/recipes

### Get recipe by uuid (Bigos)

GET http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/recipes/a0eebc99-9c0b-4ef8-bb6d-6bb9bd380a01

### Get recipes by cuisine (Polish)

GET http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/recipes?cuisineId=d290f1ee-6c54-4b01-90e6-d701748f0001

### Create recipe (Garlic Snail Stew)

POST http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cuisineId": "d290f1ee-6c54-4b01-90e6-d701748f0003",
  "authorId": "2ac72290-178b-495d-9c73-3fc3abe98533",
  "ingredients": ["snails", "garlic", "butter", "parsley", "white wine"],
  "title": "Garlic Snail Stew",
  "description": "A classic French escargot preparation.",
  "servings": 2,
  "caloriesPerServing": 410,
  "vegetarian": false
}

### Create recipe with non-existing cuisine (404)

POST http://localhost:9080/api/servlet/recipes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "cuisineId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "authorId": "2ac72290-178b-495d-9c73-3fc3abe98533",
  "ingredients": ["snails"],
  "title": "Ghost Cuisine Recipe",
  "description": "Should fail.",
  "servings": 1,
  "caloriesPerServing": 100,
  "vegetarian": false
}

